OL,4,BNorthants begin T20 Blast defence at   
OL,5,BHampshire                              
OL,6,GNorthamptonshire Steelbacks will begin 
OL,7,Gthe defence of their T20 Blast crown   
OL,8,Gwith a repeat of last season's final,  
OL,9,Gtravelling to Hampshire Hawks on       
OL,10,GFriday, 21 May.                        
OL,12,FIt is one of nine back-to-back men's   
OL,13,Fand women's matches happening across   
OL,14,Fthe opening weekend of the 2027        
OL,15,Fcampaign as the competition celebrates 
OL,16,Fits 25th edition.                      
